  "text": "Listen, we're holding a flood drill in our Rampur village. Everyone needs to be at the school by 6 PM on August 17, 2030. Oh, and everyone should bring two water bottles for themselves. If you need a ride, call 98765 43210. Just a heads-up, we'll only move to a safe place if the river crosses that red line. Also, you absolutely cannot use the market bridge."
